==Restrictions==
*Deploy from Row 1 only
*4-Crown: Max # of Deployable Cats: 10

==Battleground==
*1 [[Orthos (Enemy)|Orthos]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Celesse (Enemy)|Celesses]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Fuu (Enemy)|Fuu]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Orthos (Enemy)|Orthos]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*5 [[Celesse (Enemy)|Celesses]] spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Michelia (Enemy)|Michelia]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Serum (Enemy)|Serums]] spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

